module System

### Integer-indexed read and write access for mutable ordered sequences.
### Extends {ViewingIndexable[T]} with a write arm for the `[]` assignment operator.
### :typeparam T: The element type stored in the sequence.
protocol ModifyingIndexable[T]
obeys ViewingIndexable[T]
    ### Replaces the element at `index` with `value`.
    ### :param index: The zero-based position to update.
    ### :param value: The replacement value.
    ### :throws: {IndexOutOfBoundsError} if `index >= count()`.
    failable routine Me.setitem(index: U64, value: T)
